      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I set my own course price? <span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes — you set your own pricing within our suggested range (Kshs 500 – 15,000 for paid courses, or Free). You can also update prices anytime, run promotions, or offer coupon codes to your own audience.</div></div>
